<title>FRANCE: EU's Santer to meet both Chirac, Jospin.</title>
<headline>EU's Santer to meet both Chirac, Jospin.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commission President Jacques Santer will meet both French President Jacques Chirac and Prime Minister Lionel Jospin on Thursday, officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Their respective offices said Jospin would meet Santer at 9 a.m. (0700 GMT) and Chirac would meet him at 10 a.m. (0800 GMT).</p>
<p>Santer's visit follows French Finance Minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn's announcement on Monday that Paris needed time to study the stability pact which is designed to enforce fiscal restraint in the European economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
